    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFollowing a number of recent renovations and improvements, No. 19 Gladesville is presented in turn-key condition. Set within an attractive cul-de-sac in a well-established residential area, this three-bedroom home offers a welcoming setting for family life, just a few minutes' walk from Castlebar Town Centre, Mayo University Hospital and Atlantic Technological University.\n\nThe accommodation is arranged over two floors. An entrance hallway leads to a comfortable living room and a kitchen and dining room, providing space for both everyday living and entertaining. Upstairs are two double bedrooms, including a main bedroom with an en-suite, together with a single bedroom and family bathroom. All three bedrooms feature laminate wood flooring and fitted wardrobes. The landing also has a hot press and access to the attic via a folding stairs.\n\nTo the rear, a tiered patio offers space to sit and enjoy the outdoors, while a selection of garden sheds provides useful storage and flexibility for a range of hobbies and practical needs. With its recent improvements, cul-de-sac setting and convenient location, No. 19 Gladesville will appeal to first-time buyers, young families and investors alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>3 beds / 2 baths.</li><li>Excellent location in a quiet cul-de-sac.</li><li>Overlooking a large green area.</li><li>Very convenient to MUH & ATU.</li><li>Turn-key condition throughout.</ul>"
      },
